"The Oracle is a birth transmigrator from Xanathu and remembers much of her past life."
"Xanathu had a toxic surface, so its people lived in underground cities."
"Xanathu had solar machines, computers under its people's control, and chess."
"She values transmigrators, some more than others, and sends agents to find them."
"She has foreseen possible mass destruction across the world."
"The last Oracle tied that destruction to the Bloody Peaks, which led to the Umarii attack there."
"She says the Bloody Peaks attack could not have stopped the Hell Hound transmigrator's birth."
"The nameless one, the Hound, is most present in her visions."
"She moves Themiel, who moves Luke, who moves the Nameless Hell Hound."
"She judges Elva Wyrmscar unlikely to ascend to godhood."
"She finds it harder each day to return to her own body and the present."
